# --- Master report exceptions (track the compiled report + its figures) ---
# The report PDF and PNG figures are deliverables; GIFs stay ignored (large),
# their extracted static frames (replay_frame.png) are tracked instead.
!report/master_report.pdf
!report/**/*.png
# LaTeX build intermediates we don't want
report/*.aux
report/*.out
report/*.log
report/*.toc